"include/std.bo" require

;Acrostic, after Uiua:  "Unabashedly I utilize arrays"  ⊸≠@   ⊜⊢
;split the string into its words (Uiua partitions it by the mask of non-spaces; Bo's
;partition op does the same), then take the first letter of each.

    (
    () strsplit
        (apply 1 nth)
    map
    )
    (acrostic)
PUSH

"Unabashedly I utilize arrays" acrostic says
"  Bo   only   loves   ordered   stacks" acrostic says
